  "keyFeatures": [
    "Event-driven workflow automation with 1,000+ pre-built integrations",
    "Custom code steps in Node.js, Python, Go, and Bash",
    "Pre-built sources and actions for 1,000+ APIs",
    "Pipedream Connect: embed OAuth and API integrations in your own app",
    "MCP (Model Context Protocol) server for 2,800+ APIs",
    "Async event delivery to S3, Snowflake, HTTP, Email, and SSE",
    "SOC 2 compliant platform with managed credential storage",
    "Free tier for individual developers"
